<% content_for :title, "Catering Concept · Gor's Coffee" %>
<main class="cafe-content-page" aria-labelledby="cafe-catering-title">
  <header class="cafe-content-page__hero">
    <p class="cafe-content-page__eyebrow">Catering · Concept showcase</p>
    <h1 id="cafe-catering-title">A little coffee, a lot of good company.</h1>
    <p>Imagine a customizable coffee and pastry selection for meetings and celebrations. This page demonstrates how a catering service could be presented; it does not accept bookings or inquiries for a real café.</p>
    <%= link_to 'Browse sample items', menu_path, class: 'cafe-content-page__button' %>
  </header>

  <section class="cafe-content-page__section" aria-labelledby="cafe-catering-options">
    <h2 id="cafe-catering-options">Explore the concept</h2>
    <div class="cafe-content-page__grid">
      <article class="cafe-content-page__card">
        <p class="cafe-content-page__eyebrow">01 · Coffee bar</p>
        <h3>Coffee for a group</h3>
        <p>An example assortment of espresso classics, milk choices and iced drinks.</p>
        <%= link_to 'Coffee choices', menu_path(search: 'latte'), class: 'cafe-content-page__text-link' %>
      </article>
      <article class="cafe-content-page__card">
        <p class="cafe-content-page__eyebrow">02 · Morning treats</p>
        <h3>Bakery selection</h3>
        <p>Explore croissants, cinnamon rolls and other items from the fictional demo menu.</p>
        <%= link_to 'Browse bakery', menu_path(search: 'croissant'), class: 'cafe-content-page__text-link' %>
      </article>
      <article class="cafe-content-page__card">
        <p class="cafe-content-page__eyebrow">03 · A simple workflow</p>
        <h3>How it could work</h3>
        <p>A future production version might support enquiries, availability checks, quotes and confirmation.</p>
        <%= link_to 'See the demo basket', cart_path, class: 'cafe-content-page__text-link' %>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cafe-content-page__section" aria-labelledby="cafe-catering-process">
    <h2 id="cafe-catering-process">A possible catering journey</h2>
    <ol class="cafe-content-page__steps">
      <li><strong>Discover.</strong> Review a sample selection and dietary attributes.</li>
      <li><strong>Plan.</strong> Choose a format and estimated quantities in a future ordering flow.</li>
      <li><strong>Confirm.</strong> A real café would verify location, timing, availability and pricing before taking an order.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="cafe-content-page__fineprint">Concept only. No booking form, delivery area, prices per guest, deposits or fulfilment are configured.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="cafe-content-page__section cafe-content-page__closing" aria-labelledby="cafe-catering-next">
    <h2 id="cafe-catering-next">Want to learn more?</h2>
    <p>Read about the project, common questions and why live contact details are not displayed.</p>
    <div class="cafe-content-page__actions">
      <%= link_to 'About & FAQ', info_path(anchor: 'faq'), class: 'cafe-content-page__button' %>
      <%= link_to 'Project contact', info_path(anchor: 'contact'), class: 'cafe-content-page__button cafe-content-page__button--light' %>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
